1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Let your attention settle.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Straighten your spine.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Sit comfortably.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Open your shoulders and relax your body.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Feel your head, your shoulders, your arms.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Feel the pressure of your body on the cushion.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Feel your hands at their points of contact.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Notice how your legs and the base of your body are in contact with the floor.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Now guide your attention to your breath.

10
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Become aware of your breathing as it changes moment after moment.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Sensations arise on their own and change on their own.

12
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Just let experience be as it is.

13
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Simply rest here, aware of having a body breathing present.

